  "derivation_note": "Energy spectrum digitized from the measured INEEL iterative-adjustment curve (INEEL/EXT-01-00204 Fig.5) and region-anchored to the VTT LSL-M2 experimental integrals (Seppala 2002 Table 4); 120 log bins 1e-5..4e7 eV. Total fluence normalization unchanged. See beams/fir1-k63-spectrum-ineel-digitized.json. This variant is clipped at 20 MeV (the upper edge of the ENDF/B-VIII.1 neutron library) and renormalized; the clipped weight is 2.11e-09 of the total. Generated by beams/make-ineel-20mev.py from fir1-k63-ineel-spectrum.json."
